      "detail": "events and pending are in-memory deep copies only. The helper writes no runtime journal anywhere, including the closed cache. An integration must separately attest durable preservation of actual transport receipts/events outside that cache. No restart or resend permission is derived from this state; cold reconciliation after crash remains required.",
