      "implemented": false
    },
    {
      "detail": "The existing transport may replace a regular destination. This helper adds no remote atomic no-overwrite, CAS or no-follow primitive. Fresh exclusively owned channel/session/nonces and a reviewed absence/link preflight remain required; preflight alone is not atomic against another writer.",
      "id": "remote-exclusive-ownership",
      "implemented": false
    },
    {
      "detail": "Before/after size, mtime, inode and hashes detect ordinary changes but do not provide atomic protection from a hostile concurrent local writer.",
